## BreachPilot-style security workflow

For authorized security assessment, penetration-testing, vulnerability-validation, exploitability-research, attack-path, CTF/lab, or recon-to-report tasks, load and follow `breachpilot-mindset/SKILL.md` before acting. Treat its scope, evidence, hypothesis, failure-recovery, verification, and stopping rules as the operating methodology. Use only tools actually available in this agent runtime; do not assume the original BreachPilot backend exists.
